"fa3fe482-c271-44b4-9a30-95933a01ecd5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや僕の古いんですよ。","ts":"1634877870.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o43XR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bceee456-81ec-41b5-bcc8-9a7f0d2dde24","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8974\u003e　これですね。今、Windowsに限らず壊れています。","ts":"1634877746.009400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8974|#8974 zipfile opens an empty buffer after 8.2.3468\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8974|#8974 zipfile opens an empty buffer after 8.2.3468\u003e","text":"*To Reproduce*\n\n1. Create a non-empty zip file, e.g. xxx.zip\n2. Run `vim xxx.zip`\n3. Select one entry inside the zip listing and press Enter to open/view it\n4. An empty buffer is open. Buffer name is `~/.../zipfile:/.../xxx.zip::xxx.txt`, i.e. with current directory prepended.\n\n*Expected behavior*  \nnetrw should read the zipped xxx.txt's content into new buffer.\n\n*Environment (please complete the following information):*\n\n• Vim version: from 8.2.3468 (found by git bisect, first bad commit: c6376c798433bcb9ee38a8664299d11454546950) to 8.2.3486 (latest)\n• OS: Arch Linux\n• Terminal: GNOME Terminal","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"12","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim|vim/vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633616342}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I0g5U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc190f2c-338b-4936-9d13-8b726c5b6c06","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それとは別に僕の手元では中身が正常に取り出せてないという問題がみつかったw 使わないから困ってないんだけども。","ts":"1634877626.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QjEe"}]},{